WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.010
Blanka answers Ken’s incoming Drive Impact.

2
00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:03.550
Blanka’s DI wins as a Punish Counter.

3
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.950
Standing heavy punch starts the crumple conversion.

4
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.300
The punch continuation from Coward Crouch launches Ken.

5
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:06.600
Light Vertical Rolling Attack completes the juggle.
